      "role": "user",
      "content": "volcanic storage? i'm not sure what you mean by that, we're just using standard persistent disks on gcp. what do you mean by volcanic? and i'm not sure if statefulsets are the right move here since this is a stateless service, i just need to know how to verify the mount timing so i can rule out the race condition.",
      "source": "evaluator"
